    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Abram was ninety-nine years old the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared to Abram, and said to him, “I am God Almighty;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "El Shaddai",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " walk before me, and be blameless. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will make my covenant between me and you, and will multiply you exceedingly.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abram fell on his face; and God said to him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Behold, my covenant is with you, and you shall be the father of a multitude of nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.4.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 4.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " No longer shall your name be Abram,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "exalted father",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " but your name shall be Abraham;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Here taken to mean",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "father of a multitude",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for I have made you the father of a multitude of nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make you exceedingly fruitful; and I will make nations of you, and kings shall come forth from you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.55"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1.55",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And I will establish my covenant between me and you and your descendants after you throughout their generations for an everlasting covenant, to be God to you and to your descendants after you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And I will give to you, and to your descendants after you, the land of your sojournings, all the land of Canaan, for an everlasting possession; and I will be their God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God said to Abraham, “As for you, you shall keep my covenant, you and your descendants after you throughout their generations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " This is my covenant, which you shall keep, between me and you and your descendants after you: Every male among you shall be circumcised. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 17.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " You shall be circumcised in the flesh of your foreskins, and it shall be a sign of the covenant between me and you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that is eight days old among you shall be circumcised; every male throughout your generations, whether born in your house, or bought with your money from any foreigner who is not of your offspring, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "both he that is born in your house and he that is bought with your money, shall be circumcised. So shall my covenant be in your flesh an everlasting covenant. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Any uncircumcised male who is not circumcised in the flesh of his foreskin shall be cut off from his people; he has broken my covenant.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And God said to Abraham, “As for Sarai your wife, you shall not call her name Sarai, but Sarah shall be her name. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bless her, and moreover I will give you a son by her; I will bless her, and she shall be a mother of nations; kings of peoples shall come from her.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abraham fell on his face and laughed, and said to himself, “Shall a child be born to a man who is a hundred years old? Shall Sarah, who is ninety years old, bear a child?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abraham said to God, “O that Ishmael might live in thy sight!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God said, “No, but Sarah your wife shall bear you a son, and you shall call his name Isaac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "he laughs",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I will establish my covenant with him as an everlasing covenant for his descendants after him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As for Ishmael, I have heard you; behold, I will bless him and make him fruitful and multiply him exceedingly; he shall be the father of twelve princes, and I will make him a great nation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will establish my covenant with Isaac, whom Sarah shall bear to you at this season next year.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he had finished talking with him, God went up from Abraham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abraham took Ishmael his son and all the slaves born in his house or bought with his money, every male among the men of Abraham's house, and he circumcised the flesh of their foreskins that very day, as God had said to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham was ninety-nine years old when he was circumcised in the flesh of his foreskin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Ishmael his son was thirteen years old when he was circumcised in the flesh of his foreskin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
